  {"text":"Window 3","translation":"3番窓口","where":"worlds/window-3/scenes/window-3/scene.json title"},
  {"text":"An electronic queue at the asteroid belt. Nobody here is in a hurry. Except you.","translation":"小惑星帯の電子整理券。ここでは誰も急いでいない。あなた以外は。","where":"worlds/window-3/scenes/window-3/scene.json caption"},
  {"text":"Belt-East checkpoint. Forty minutes' flight to Jupiter. Eleven days to the window.","translation":"ベルト東検問所。木星まで飛行四十分。窓口まで十一日。","where":"worlds/window-3/scenes/window-3/scene.json captions[0] text"},
  {"text":"They invented the warp drive. They couldn't get rid of form F-12 in triplicate.","translation":"ワープドライブは発明された。だが、F-12様式の三通提出だけは廃止できなかった。","where":"worlds/window-3/scenes/window-3/scene.json captions[1] text"},
  {"text":"Gena filled it in twice. The third copy floated away.","translation":"ゲーナは二通書き上げた。三通目は飛んでいってしまった。","where":"worlds/window-3/scenes/window-3/scene.json captions[2] text"},
  {"text":"Window 3 is open again.","translation":"3番窓口が再開しました。","where":"worlds/window-3/scenes/window-3/script.js"},
  {"text":"Window 3 has closed for a technical break.","translation":"3番窓口はシステム休憩に入りました。","where":"worlds/window-3/scenes/window-3/script.js"},
  {"text":"A golden yacht with a flashing light went straight to the window, no queue. Your number has been recalculated.","translation":"回転灯をつけた金色のヨットが、列を無視して窓口へ直行した。あなたの番号は再計算されました。","where":"worlds/window-3/scenes/window-3/script.js"},
  {"text":"≈ {days} days","translation":"≈ {days} 日","where":"worlds/window-3/scenes/window-3/widgets/board.html"},
